                  "explanation": "Employee referrals consistently outperform every other channel on the three metrics that matter: retention (about 45% higher at year 2), ramp speed, and total cost per hire. The referring employee provides a culture pre-screen the ATS cannot. LinkedIn and AHIMA are strong for specialized roles, Indeed for volume, and agencies for urgency — but referrals win on quality. That's why mature departments fund a referral bonus program even at $1,000+ per hire.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Highest-quality sourcing channel</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">EMPLOYEE REFERRALS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">+45% retention at year 2</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Faster ramp, lower total cost</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">The referring employee acts as a culture pre-screen</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"420\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WHY OTHER CHANNELS LOSE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">LinkedIn: strong but cold outreach</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Indeed: volume, low signal</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Agencies: 20-25% fee, unknown fit</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"650\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"705\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">PRACTICAL TAKEAWAY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Fund a $500-$2,000 referral bonus</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">It pays for itself in retention alone</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Always push referrals first when a req opens</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Referrals win on every quality metric"
                  }
