                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Match the method to the manager's need</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">MBO — MANAGEMENT BY OBJECTIVES</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Manager and employee agree on goals up front</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Performance measured against those exact goals</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Best when goals are measurable and shared</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"440\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">CDI MBO EXAMPLE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Achieve 28% query rate</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">at 80% physician agree rate</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">by Q4 2026</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"690\" width=\"940\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WHEN TO USE WHICH</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Graphic rating: fast, light, biased</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">BARS: when objectivity matters</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">360-degree: development, not pay</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"945\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Critical Incident: legal defensibility</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"985\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">MBO: goal-driven roles like CDI</text></svg>",
